# Next 15.5.x + React 19 bundling breaks under pnpm node-linker=hoisted (duplicate React executes during prerender; useContext/useState read null). pnpm default isolated linker keeps apps/web/node_modules self-contained -> build green. (verif: next.js#86178/#94810; isolated only change vs committed next.config/tsconfig, 5/5 routes.)
node-linker=isolated
